OL,3,GNEWSAPair deny fake passport plot for
OL,4,Amurder suspect
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men accused of helping a man
OL,7,Fcharged with a double murder have told
OL,8,Fa court they were unaware they were
OL,9,Finvolved in a plot to obtain a fake
OL,10,Fpassport.
OL,12,FMohammed Maneer Khan, 39, is accused of
OL,13,Fmurdering Duaine Mills, 28, and Syed
OL,14,FZain Ali, 32, in Harrow Street,
OL,15,FWolverhampton, in the early hours of 19
OL,16,FSeptember 2025.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
