OL,3,GNEWSAPair deny fake passport plot for
OL,4,Amurder suspect
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe pleaded not guilty to two counts of
OL,7,Fmurder, one count of attempted murder
OL,8,Fand possession of a firearm with intent
OL,9,Fto endanger life but has admitted fraud
OL,10,Fafter attempting to obtain a passport
OL,11,Fin a false name.
OL,13,FSamir Patel and Yaseen Patel have
OL,14,Fdenied doing acts intended to pervert
OL,15,Fthe course of justice between 18
OL,16,FSeptember and 21 November last year.
